<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-K GROUP NET RISES IN 1996.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-K GROUP NET RISES IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Krakaw group results for</p>
<p>the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		    25.21   vs   15.33</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			27.39   vs   16.70</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    12.04   vs    5.71</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    190.91   vs  117.08</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		     147.88   vs   92.41</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit	     412.00   vs   97.80</p>
<p>    Group income tax			    10.93   vs    7.02</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			    0.46   vs    1.05</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		   4.98   vs    2.88</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			3.24   vs    1.80</p>
<p>    Group investment			    16.56   vs    3.64</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
